      players: "Three players. Play is clockwise. Any player may deal first; the turn to deal passes clockwise. In each deal the three roles are: dealer (deals and has a quota of 1 trick in trump contracts, 7 in mizerka), forehand or left of dealer (chooses the contract after seeing six cards and has quota 7 in trump contracts, 1 in mizerka), and middlehand or right of dealer (quota 5 in both). The player to dealer's left leads to the first trick.",
